Subject: [PATCH 03/13] Plutonium: the helper, pairing, network access and the
 boot error

Folded from:
- use the Plutonium helper and its agent bridge
- the shell pairs with the launcher's token only when it needs to
- pair from a browser over the addresses the server reports
- network access from the shell's settings
- the boot error reloads by itself once the server answers
- the app is Hydra
